    LineComment "// match is the type-dispatch control statement: it branches on the runtime type"
    Newline "\n"
    LineComment "// of a union (or optional) value, narrowing the value to that member type inside"
    Newline "\n"
    LineComment "// the arm. Each arm is a type pattern — a member type with an optional binding"
    Newline "\n"
    LineComment "// name, or the wildcard \"_\" — and its body is a statement (an early return) or a"
    Newline "\n"
    LineComment "// block, so a match dispatches a value by returning from the matching arm. match"
    Newline "\n"
    LineComment "// branches on a value's *type* (a union); switch (E-11) branches on its *value*."
    Newline "\n"
